    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I appreciate you saying that but it's not really true is it. \"strength\" doesn't cover it. I made a choice and people died. that's not a matter of empathy, that's just what happened.\n\nthe VA counselor said similar stuff. it didn't land then either. I know what I did.\n\nI'm not looking to feel better about it. I'm not sure I should.",
